Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.28,0:01:53.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.48,0:01:56.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother Qian Mu forbade us from following him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.16,0:01:57.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,When he comes out and sees all this,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:01:59.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you think he will scold us
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.72,0:02:00.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,for acting without his permission ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.44,0:02:04.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,We just built a residence near his cave,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:06.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's nothing serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.36,0:02:07.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:09.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,cultivators like good environments.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.76,0:02:12.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,We made this place this beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.36,0:02:13.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,he won’t get angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.04,0:02:15.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Sister Liu Wei,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.08,0:02:17.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.52,0:02:20.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,After we spread rumors of Senior Brother Qian Mu,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.48,0:02:24.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ve collected a year's worth of souls in just a few months.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.16,0:02:25.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.48,0:02:27.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.08,0:02:30.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,visitors are getting more frequent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.92,0:02:32.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,If Senior Brother Qian Mu finds out
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.56,0:02:35.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,we’ve been using his reputation to collect souls,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.68,0:02:36.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,he won’t forgive us !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.40,0:02:38.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't think so...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.36,0:02:41.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Brother Qian Mu,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.88,0:02:44.80,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1562,564)\fad(300,300)}Guo Dongjian\NSoul Refining Sect Inner disciple\NEarly stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.20,0:02:44.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am Guo Dongjian.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.76,0:02:47.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I hope we can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.56,0:02:53.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nascent Soul cultivation !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.44,0:03:08.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Damn it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.48,0:03:09.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,we're in big trouble !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.56,0:03:12.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:52.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Thousand-Soul Flag illusion ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.76,0:03:57.68,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(335,446)\fad(300,000)}Thousand-Soul Flag
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:03:55.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I also have
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.68,0:03:57.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,a Thousand-Soul Flag !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.76,0:03:59.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Surrender your Soul Flag
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:00.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I’ll let you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.64,0:04:02.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you can defeat me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.96,0:04:04.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ll hand it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.76,0:04:08.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother, be careful !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.20,0:04:10.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vortex !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.44,0:04:21.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Among the Soul Refining Mountain disciples
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.04,0:04:23.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,only 2 have mastered the Soul Vortex...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.44,0:04:24.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,How is this possible ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.48,0:04:30.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(189,551)}3 months ago
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.76,0:04:30.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.36,0:04:41.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,This beast is stronger than me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.44,0:04:44.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't act recklessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.80,0:04:49.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,For now, I must focus on using the Spirit Vein to cultivate
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.96,0:04:51.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,and restore my Origin Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.88,0:05:20.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now that my cultivation is at Peak Nascent Soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.60,0:05:21.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,it might be worth
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.48,0:05:24.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,studying Soul Flag spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.56,0:05:27.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,The 3 Soul Refining Mountain spells are
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.64,0:05:28.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Condense,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.16,0:05:29.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Soul Vortex
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.20,0:05:31.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,and Blood Sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.00,0:05:32.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Condense
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.16,0:05:35.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the foundation of Soul Refining.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.16,0:05:36.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,It shapes ethereal souls
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.64,0:05:38.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,into tangible forms
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.36,0:05:39.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,and puts them
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.68,0:05:41.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,inside a Soul Flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:43.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Soul Vortex spell
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.84,0:05:45.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,is very rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.48,0:05:46.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only at Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.00,0:05:49.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,can one try to master it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.72,0:05:49.28,Second,,0,0,0,,Vortex
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:51.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once the Soul Vortex is activated
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.76,0:05:54.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,it can rapidly absorb large amounts of souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.64,0:05:57.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whether it is used for fighting or stealing souls
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.08,0:06:00.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,it is extremely powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.80,0:06:06.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Senior Brother Qian Mu, on mastering the Soul Vortex...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.24,0:06:08.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior offers this Thousand-Soul Flag as a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.76,0:06:12.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Junior
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.96,0:06:14.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,will take his leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:15.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.08,0:06:23.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you know who in the Soul Extracting Mountain has the jade slip ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.60,0:06:25.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Su Jinshi of the Soul Extracting Mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.16,0:06:26.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can trade with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.08,0:07:02.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I congratulate Brother Qian Mu
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.48,0:07:04.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,on recovering most of his cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.96,0:07:09.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Liu Mei,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.28,0:07:11.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,what are you here for ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.56,0:07:14.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't make things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.44,0:07:16.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.36,0:07:17.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,you’re in grave danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.76,0:07:18.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,You must leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.96,0:07:20.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Leave planet Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.60,0:07:21.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,You don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.08,0:07:24.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,but Red Butterfly was killed by my Senior Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.36,0:07:30.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,It looks like my duel with Red Butterfly
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.68,0:07:33.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,was merely a dogfight for certain people...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.84,0:07:41.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Leave,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.64,0:07:42.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,the sooner, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.96,0:07:44.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’m doing this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.36,0:07:58.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Liu Mei appears kind
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.00,0:08:01.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I keep having this weird feeling about her...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.80,0:08:08.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,The weak expressions of these two...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.96,0:08:09.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother, be careful !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.60,0:08:14.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now I understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.20,0:08:18.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Liu Mei is showing all those emotions
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.96,0:08:21.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,to keep her true ruthless nature
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.28,0:08:24.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,hidden deep in her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.80,0:08:29.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Liu Mei didn’t attack me while my cultivation was weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.96,0:08:31.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Her goal isn't killing me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.76,0:08:33.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,but she definitely doesn’t have any good intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.44,0:08:38.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you two helped me see Liu Mei’s true nature,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.28,0:08:39.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ll spare your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.80,0:08:42.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The most urgent matter now
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.72,0:08:44.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,is mending my Origin Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.96,0:08:53.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I absorb more energy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.96,0:08:55.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,and increase the pressure,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.16,0:08:58.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will further compress my Origin Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.36,0:08:59.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,and speed up my recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.00,0:09:23.12,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(328,488)\fad(300,300)}Wang Lin's avatar\NEarly stage Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.48,0:09:21.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am back at Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.36,0:09:24.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,but my Origin Soul's healing has stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.76,0:09:26.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mending my Origin Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:28.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,will require stronger spiritual energy pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.28,0:09:42.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Damn animal !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.00,0:09:44.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ancestor has decreed that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.92,0:09:47.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,the 3 Soul Flags beneath the 3 mountains
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.92,0:09:46.80,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(341,444)\fad(300,000)}Ten Thousand-Soul Flag
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.88,0:09:49.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,belong whoever who can refine them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.92,0:09:51.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,After my last failure,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.80,0:09:54.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I spent decades preparing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.80,0:09:55.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,This time
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.08,0:09:58.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will surely be mine !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.84,0:10:15.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Blood Sacrifice !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.80,0:10:20.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Blood Sacrifice,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.36,0:10:23.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,the last of the 3 Soul Refining spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.56,0:10:24.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,It can multiply the Soul Flag’s power
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.96,0:10:26.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,by several times.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.60,0:10:43.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's one more ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.76,0:10:45.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Finally, you're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.36,0:10:47.92,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(338,445)\fad(300,300)}Soul Sealing Bell
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.68,0:10:49.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I lost last time to this second primary soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.84,0:10:51.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,This time, I’ll capture you !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.60,0:10:59.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's working !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.52,0:11:20.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,How come there's a third primary soul !?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.36,0:11:21.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could there be
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.32,0:11:22.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,a fourth one ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.16,0:11:25.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.84,0:11:26.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ll return later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.48,0:11:36.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's weird,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.60,0:11:39.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,a single Soul Flag can’t have so many primary souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.40,0:11:44.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,There is only one possibility,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.60,0:11:45.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,they’re all secondary souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.08,0:11:53.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must keep taunting the secondary souls
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.16,0:11:55.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,to force the primary soul out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.96,0:11:58.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Subduing this Soul Flag
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.20,0:12:00.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,is worth a try !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.84,0:12:17.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:20.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,a Qilin soul fragment ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.48,0:12:32.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Qilin soul fragment
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.88,0:12:35.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,even if it's weaker than Ling Tianhou’s living Qilin,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.56,0:12:37.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,has a memory inheritance
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.16,0:12:38.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,and can cast spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.00,0:12:40.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Its power
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.20,0:12:42.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,is comparable to Peak Late stage Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.88,0:12:48.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Vortex !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.16,0:12:50.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let’s see
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.56,0:12:52.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,how long your soul energy can last !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.96,0:13:24.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Damn animal !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.16,0:13:27.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,God Slaying Chariot,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.32,0:13:29.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,activate !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.24,0:13:42.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you were at full strength
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.08,0:13:45.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,you wouldn’t fear a beast soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.36,0:13:46.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,But now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.88,0:13:48.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,you’re just a soul fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.88,0:14:01.44,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1632,442)\fad(300,300)}Hundred Thousand-Soul Flag
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.40,0:14:08.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Hundred Thousand-Soul Flag !?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.32,0:14:13.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rise !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.24,0:14:29.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Qilin primary soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.36,0:14:31.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,return !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.08,0:14:47.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,The energy fluctuations
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.44,0:14:50.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,didn’t attract the attention of the Soul Refining Sect’s Soul Formation Elders.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.36,0:14:53.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,The top priority now
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.68,0:14:56.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,is to gather the 3 jade slips of spells for the Soul Flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.36,0:15:03.28,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1549,521)\fad(300,000)}Su Jinshi\NSoul Refining Sect Inner disciple
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.56,0:15:11.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Soul Refining Mountain disciple ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.68,0:15:13.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hand over the Soul Extracting jade slip.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.60,0:15:17.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can’t see through his cultivation...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.60,0:15:21.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can give you the Soul Extracting jade slip
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:24.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I have a Soul Flag
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.88,0:15:27.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,that is still missing 300 souls fragments
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.08,0:15:30.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,to become a Thousand-Soul Flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.36,0:15:31.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you can give me 300 souls,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.28,0:15:33.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ll give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.56,0:15:50.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother is decisive,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.68,0:15:51.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,how should I address you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.44,0:15:53.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Qian Mu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.36,0:15:56.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,So it’s Senior Brother Qian Mu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.92,0:15:59.08,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(350,449)\fad(300,200)}Soul Extracting jade
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.68,0:16:01.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,This jade slip
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.16,0:16:02.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,records how to extract souls
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.20,0:16:04.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,and
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.44,0:16:08.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,the method to prevent them from dissipating.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.64,0:16:14.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother Qian Mu,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.56,0:16:19.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you plan to get the Soul Sealing jade next ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.48,0:16:24.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother, don’t bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.20,0:16:25.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Soul Sealing jade slip
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.76,0:16:28.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,is only accessible to Soul Formation Elders.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.60,0:16:30.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ordinary disciples
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.76,0:16:33.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,only use Soul Refining and Extracting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.08,0:16:37.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,The final Soul Flag spell
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:39.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,is only for Soul Formation Elders ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.88,0:16:41.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Origin Soul’s recovery
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.64,0:16:43.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,requires even greater pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:47.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.40,0:16:48.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,why not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.04,0:17:06.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Elders of the Soul Refining Sect,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.52,0:17:08.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,come out and fight me !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.62,0:17:31.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To let go of the consequences of my actions
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.92,0:17:33.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}is to ignore the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.68,0:17:35.58,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}like scattered ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.46,0:17:43.06,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}As destiny falls
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.30,0:17:43.06,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.06,0:17:50.66,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}It makes the mountains lose their colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.30,0:17:50.66,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}wither and melt into rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.10,0:17:58.22,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Who can deceive
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.86,0:17:58.22,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the law of the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.54,0:18:01.54,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Countless generations
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.82,0:18:01.54,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}have tried before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.83,0:18:05.26,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}But how could I not catch my dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.66,0:18:05.26,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}within my warm fingers ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.82,0:18:09.34,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're at my side when I'm alone
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.34,0:18:12.66,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.42,0:18:16.62,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.98,0:18:20.82,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.82,0:18:20.82,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}in the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.98,0:18:25.78,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.54,0:18:25.78,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Can I break the rules ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.79,0:18:28.50,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}To run towards you !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.54,0:18:31.82,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.82,0:18:36.46,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}to cut down this tribulation with my own hands
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.46,0:18:39.86,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and break through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.90,0:18:44.54,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}All of that for the stars in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.99,0:18:50.22,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.34,0:18:54.14,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}If your soul is willing to wander,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.14,0:18:58.78,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}can I still take your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.82,0:18:58.78,Ending77,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and hold them tight ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.94,0:19:01.86,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.86,0:19:06.74,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.75,0:19:10.02,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I dream of destroying
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.18,0:19:14.74,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}the shackles of our fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.74,0:19:18.70,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.70,0:19:21.50,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}You're the hardest to let go of.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.58,0:19:25.38,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I want to be with you again
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.46,0:19:28.74,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}so I can look in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.02,0:19:33.98,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,1500}Even for a moment, it's worth it.
